  "problem": {
    "source": "",
    "keyPoints": {
      "title": "解题要点",
      "lead": "",
      "items": [
        "观察结构：\\(a^4，b^4\\) 是一对正项，应用基本不等式后得到 \\(2(ab)^2\\)，恰好与剩余项 \\(-8ab\\) 统一到 \\(ab\\)",
        "应用基本不等式消元：\\(a^4+b^4\\ge2\\sqrt{a^4b^4}=2(ab)^2\\)，因此原式不小于 \\(2(ab)^2-8ab\\)",
        "积换元求一元二次式范围：令 \\(p=ab>0\\)，配方得 \\(2p^2-8p=2(p-2)^2-8\\ge-8\\)",
        "验证取等：基本不等式与配方同时取等，要求 \\(a^4=b^4\\) 且 \\(ab=2\\)，结合正数条件得 \\(a=b=\\sqrt2\\)"
      ]
    },
    "lines": [
      {
        "text": "已知 \\(a>0，b>0\\)，求 \\(a^4+b^4-8ab\\) 的最小值。"
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "section": "找对称结构",
      "title": "观察结构",
      "t": 0,
      "showDiagram": false,
      "visual": {
        "kind": "basic-inequality-structure-scan",
        "condition": {
          "label": "变量范围",
          "expression": "\\(a>0，b>0\\)",
          "tag": "四次项为正"
        },
        "target": {
          "label": "目标整式",
          "expression": "\\(a^4+b^4-8ab\\)",
          "tag": "含四次项与积"
        },
        "organization": {
          "label": "预判基本不等式消元后的结构",
          "steps": [
            {
              "label": "配对",
              "expression": "\\(a^4+b^4\\)"
            },
            {
              "label": "配对结果",
              "expression": "\\(2(ab)^2\\)"
            },
            {
              "label": "剩余项",
              "expression": "\\(-8ab\\)"
            }
          ],
          "note": "两部分最终都只含 ab，可以继续积换元"
        },
        "reading": "同归于 ab",
        "route": "应用基本不等式消元"
      },
      "reasoning": [
        {
          "kind": "because",
          "text": "\\(a>0，b>0\\)，所以 \\(a^4，b^4\\) 是一对正项"
        },
        {
          "kind": "because",
          "text": "这两个正项的几何平均数为 \\(\\sqrt{a^4b^4}=a^2b^2=(ab)^2\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "because",
          "text": "原式的剩余项 \\(-8ab\\) 也只含 \\(ab\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "先对 \\(a^4+b^4\\) 应用基本不等式，即可消去分立的 \\(a，b\\)，为积换元创造条件"
        }
      ],
      "derive": [
        [
          "结构判断",
          "基本不等式消元后只含 ab"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "section": "找对称结构",
      "title": "应用基本不等式消元",
      "t": 0,
      "showDiagram": false,
      "visual": {
        "kind": "basic-inequality-mapping",
        "methodTag": "找对称结构｜基本不等式消元",
        "templateLabel": "代入基本不等式",
        "template": "\\(u+v\\ge2\\sqrt{uv}\\)",
        "formulaStyle": "sum-geometric",
        "showPositiveStep": true,
        "mappings": [
          {
            "slot": "第一个正项",
            "shape": "square",
            "value": "\\(a^4\\)",
            "condition": "\\(a^4>0\\)"
          },
          {
            "slot": "第二个正项",
            "shape": "circle",
            "value": "\\(b^4\\)",
            "condition": "\\(b^4>0\\)"
          }
        ],
        "mappedSum": "\\(a^4+b^4\\)",
        "mappedProduct": "\\((ab)^4\\)",
        "mapped": "\\(a^4+b^4\\ge2\\sqrt{(ab)^4}\\)",
        "stageLabel": "代入两个四次项",
        "fixedSourceTarget": "product",
        "fixedSourceLabel": "恒等关系",
        "fixedCondition": "\\(a^4b^4=(ab)^4\\)",
        "replacementText": "化简几何平均数",
        "replaced": "\\(a^4+b^4\\ge2(ab)^2\\)",
        "simplifyLabel": "带回完整目标",
        "substituted": "\\(a^4+b^4-8ab\\ge2(ab)^2-8ab\\)",
        "conclusionLabel": "完成消元",
        "conclusion": "\\(a^4+b^4-8ab\\ge2(ab)^2-8ab\\)"
      },
      "reasoning": [
        {
          "kind": "because",
          "text": "\\(a^4>0，b^4>0\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "\\(a^4+b^4\\ge2\\sqrt{a^4b^4}=2(ab)^2\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "\\(a^4+b^4-8ab\\ge2(ab)^2-8ab\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "估计后的式子只含基本对称量 \\(ab\\)，完成消元"
        }
      ],
      "derive": [
        [
          "消元结果",
          "原式≥2(ab)²−8ab"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "section": "找对称结构",
      "title": "积换元求一元二次式范围",
      "t": 0,
      "showDiagram": false,
      "visual": {
        "kind": "basic-inequality-structure-scan",
        "showFocus": false,
        "condition": {
          "label": "换元范围",
          "expression": "\\(p=ab>0\\)",
          "tag": "积变量"
        },
        "target": {
          "label": "一元二次式",
          "expression": "\\(2p^2-8p\\)",
          "tag": "开口向上"
        },
        "organization": {
          "label": "积换元后，配方求一元二次式的范围",
          "steps": [
            {
              "label": "积换元",
              "expression": "\\(p=ab>0\\)"
            },
            {
              "label": "化为一元式",
              "expression": "\\(2p^2-8p\\)"
            },
            {
              "label": "配方",
              "expression": "\\(2(p-2)^2-8\\)"
            },
            {
              "label": "取值范围",
              "expression": "\\([-8，+\\infty)\\)"
            }
          ]
        },
        "reading": "一元二次式",
        "route": "配方求范围"
      },
      "reasoning": [
        {
          "kind": "because",
          "text": "令 \\(p=ab\\)，由 \\(a>0，b>0\\) 得 \\(p>0\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "\\(2(ab)^2-8ab=2p^2-8p\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "\\(2p^2-8p=2(p-2)^2-8\\ge-8\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "because",
          "text": "\\(p=2\\) 满足 \\(p>0\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "一元二次式 \\(2p^2-8p\\) 的取值范围为 \\([-8，+\\infty)\\)，原式的下界为 \\(-8\\)"
        }
      ],
      "derive": [
        [
          "一元二次式范围",
          "[-8,+∞)"
        ],
        [
          "原式下界",
          "-8"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "section": "找对称结构",
      "title": "验证取等",
      "t": 0,
      "showDiagram": false,
      "visual": {
        "kind": "basic-inequality-equality-check",
        "templateLabel": "基本不等式取等",
        "first": {
          "value": "\\(a^4\\)",
          "shape": "square"
        },
        "second": {
          "value": "\\(b^4\\)",
          "shape": "circle"
        },
        "conditionLabel": "结合配方取等",
        "condition": "\\(p=ab=2\\)",
        "solved": "\\(a=b=\\sqrt2\\)",
        "verificationLabel": "代回目标",
        "verification": "\\((\\sqrt2)^4+(\\sqrt2)^4-8(\\sqrt2)(\\sqrt2)=-8\\)",
        "conclusion": "\\(a^4+b^4-8ab\\) 的最小值为 \\(-8\\)"
      },
      "reasoning": [
        {
          "kind": "because",
          "text": "基本不等式取等 ⇔ \\(a^4=b^4\\)；由 \\(a，b>0\\) 得 \\(a=b\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "because",
          "text": "一元二次式在 \\(p=2\\) 时取到最小值，所以 \\(ab=2\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "联立 \\(a=b\\) 与 \\(ab=2\\)，得 \\(a=b=\\sqrt2\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "代回原式得到 \\(-8\\)，因此下界可以取得"
        }
      ],
      "derive": [
        [
          "最小值",
          "-8"
        ],
        [
          "等号条件",
          "a=b=√2"
        ]
      ]
    }
  ],
